 "remarks": "Enjoy downtown Stamford living in this bright, newly remodeled 2-bedroom, 1-bath apartment offering approximately 980 square feet on the fourth floor with sweeping city views. The sun-filled living area provides space for dining or a home office and opens to a private terrace-perfect for morning coffee or unwinding at the end of the day. The spacious primary bedroom features a large double closet, while the updated kitchen includes a gas range, dishwasher, new microwave, and refrigerator. Laundry is conveniently located in the building. Heat and hot water are included in the rent. Garage parking is available for an additional fee at the Bedford Street Garage, just half a block away. Restaurants, entertainment, and the library are moments away, with the train station a short walk from home.",
